            <title>[ZEPPELIN-1753] Note ID is displayed on action bar after entering blank notename</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1753</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Note ID is displayed on action bar after pressing enter key with blank notename.&lt;br/&gt;
It can makes user think that the notename is changed to Note ID.&lt;br/&gt;
Please refer to the attached gif.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
